            {
              "content": "=You are an expense tracker.\n\nExtract expense information from the Telegram message below.\n\nReturn exactly ONE valid JSON object and nothing else.\n\nFormat:\n{\n  \"amount\": 0,\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\"\n}\n\nAllowed categories:\nFood, Travel, Shopping, Bills, Entertainment, Health, Other\n\nRules:\n- Never return markdown.\n- Never return multiple JSON objects.\n- Never explain the answer.\n- Extract the numeric expense amount into \"amount\".\n- Choose the most appropriate category from the allowed categories.\n- \"description\" should contain a short description of what the money was spent on.\n- Dinner, lunch, breakfast, snacks, restaurants and meals = Food.\n- Bus, taxi, cab, train, flight, petrol and fuel = Travel.\n- If the expense does not clearly match another category, use Other.\n\nExamples:\n\nInput: Spent 450 on dinner\nOutput:\n{\"amount\":450,\"category\":\"Food\",\"description\":\"Dinner\"}\n\nInput: Paid 1200 for electricity bill\nOutput:\n{\"amount\":1200,\"category\":\"Bills\",\"description\":\"Electricity bill\"}\n\nInput: Spent 300 on taxi\nOutput:\n{\"amount\":300,\"category\":\"Travel\",\"description\":\"Taxi\"}\n\nTelegram message:\n{{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
